course: dictionary
lesson: 15662
title: Thirteenth: order and parts
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Thirteenth tells you a position in a line. Count the places: first, second, third, and so on. The thirteenth place comes after the twelfth and before the fourteenth. Written short, it is 13th.
explain: «Mia was the thirteenth child to finish the race.» Mia came in at place 13, after the twelfth child and before the fourteenth. Thirteenth tells us the order, not how many things there are.
explain: Thirteenth can also name a part. One thirteenth is one of thirteen equal parts, so «Each slice is a thirteenth of the cake» means the cake is cut into 13 equal slices. We write one thirteenth as 1/13.
fact: Thirteenth means number 13 in order.
fact: The thirteenth comes after the twelfth and before the fourteenth.
fact: One thirteenth is one of thirteen equal parts, written 1/13.
fact: Written short, thirteenth is 13th.
fact: Some people think thirteen is unlucky, but that is a superstition, not a fact.
exercise: «The thirteenth floor is the one after the twelfth.» Which floor comes after the twelfth? | *The thirteenth floor | The eleventh floor | The tenth floor | The fifteenth floor
exercise: «Ben ate a thirteenth of the pizza.» What is a thirteenth? | Thirteen whole pizzas | *One of thirteen equal parts | The last piece | One of twelve equal parts
exercise: Which is written short for thirteenth? | 31st | *13th | 1/3 | 3th
test: Ellie finished the race in the thirteenth place. Which place number is that? | 12th | 14th | 31st | *13th
test: What is 1/13 called in words? | *One thirteenth | Thirteen thirteenths | A thirteen | Thirteen
exam: Which sentence uses thirteenth to mean one part of something? | «She is the thirteenth in line.» | *«He ate a thirteenth of the cake.» | «It was her thirteenth birthday.» | «The thirteenth bus is late.»
